    #noammostrings = ["Tracks empty! No more beats to drop.","No arrows remain. I must wait.","My harmony is spent. I must restore it.","Weapon dry—nothing left!","Sidearm’s empty. Back to healing.","No rockets. Payload exhausted.","Well that’s a dud—no shots left!","My weapon is spent. Replenishing needed.","Weapons dry—fists will have to do.","Clip’s empty. Nothing left!","[frustrated beeps and whirs]","No shells left. Guns are dry.","My blades are not the problem. My ammo is.","Outta bullets. This is a problem.","Cannon dry. Must recharge.","Gun’s empty. Nothing left to fire.","No ammo left! Systems dry.","Hold on i'm out of charges!","My hammer never runs dry—but my cannon does.","Scrap’s gone. I’ve got nothing left.","My weapon is out—no energy remains.","Ammunition depleted. Nothing left to draw.","My stores are drained. I’ll need more.","Snow’s run out! Nothing left!","Gun’s empty. No more rounds.","Dry already? Heh—time to get personal!","Railgun’s dry. No charge remaining.","Nada left. Totally empty!","Guns are out! Nothing left!","Magazine empty. I am dry.","No juice left—nothing to give.","[angry squeaks; guns click empty]","Reserves depleted. Nothing remains.","Out of steel—blades must wait.","Toxins exhausted. Nothing left to burn.","My weapon’s spent. All energy is gone.","Bah! Outta rounds—got nothin’ left!","My petals are spent—nothing remains.","Mag’s empty. Nothing left inside.","Ofuda’s gone. Nothing more to give.","Running low? No—I’m out.","Drills dry. Power’s gone.","Outta lead… nothing left but knuckles.","My wrath is endless, even without ammunition."]
