    #followerbuyMsg = [ "  The beat drops, but the wallet doesn't.", "  You require more points to fuel the dragon's fury.", "  Your emptiness hinders our path to enlightenment.", "  Your mission requires adequate funding, soldier.", "  Your reserves are depleted, angel.", "  Refuel the jetpack with more points, commander.", "  Your explosive plans require more points.", "  Allocate more points for the realization of this vision.", "  Our path to dominance is blocked by insufficient funds.", "  To heal and protect, we require sustenance.", "  Boop beep boop?", "  Feed this darkness with more points.", "  Your spirit is strong, but your balance is weak. Seek points.", "  This heist requires more capital, partner.", "  Acquire more points to fuel your power.", "  No scrap metal without points, you know?", "  More points, or it's game over!", "  Father would be disappointed.", "  Beer!", "  My forge runs cold without fuel", "  Our gravitational experiments require additional energy.", "  Your systems require upgrades.", "  Acquire more points for scientific advancement.", "  My experiments require more cryogenic energy.", "  Your appetite is greater than your funds.", "  Mauga don’t fight for free—bring more points.", "  Precision firepower demands more than pocket change.", "  Secrets cost more than this—get points.", "  Blink into affordability first.", "  Patience. True precision is expensive.", "  Even a scientist can’t fund this plan without points.", "  Momentum denied—insufficient funding.", "  Evolution requires greater investment.", "  Freja needs more strength… and more points.", "  Hazard requires more resources to unleash chaos.", "  Sunlight blooms only with more offerings.", "  Queens don’t fight for free—show respect with points.", "  Life demands greater sacrifice than this.", "  Juno waits for those who invest more.", "  Even the clever fox needs more offerings.", "  Vision requires funding, sharpshooter.", "  Venture deeper only when you can afford it